WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.992
A set keeps only unique values.

00:00:02.992 --> 00:00:08.472
The channels list contains web three times and email twice.

00:00:08.472 --> 00:00:16.036
When we convert it to a set, the duplicates disappear and we are left with web, email, and store.

00:00:16.771 --> 00:00:20.253
Do not depend on a set for meaningful ordering.

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:23.258
Its main purpose here is uniqueness.

00:00:23.258 --> 00:00:30.951
Sets are useful when you need distinct categories, unique IDs, or a quick count of unique values.
